echo \"성공=\$((peakvtu-403)) 총\$peakvtu/1000 실행중=\$nrun(\$run) 남은=\$((162-(peakvtu-403)-nrun)) passEND=\$pass\";
echo \"failcases: \$faillist\";
echo wrap=\$(pgrep -cf '[r]un_peak_batch.sh') orch=\$(pgrep -cf '[p]ymapdl_peak_pool.py') disk=\$(df -h /home|tail -1|awk '{print \$4}');
du -sh solid_data/case_*/ansys_results_type1_expB_new/peaktmp 2>/dev/null|sort -rh|head -3"

ssh ws2 "cd /home/jeff/project/54_analysis;
echo '=== 지속 실패 케이스들 최근 에러 유형 분류 ===';
for c in 120 147 15 163 37 43 93 96 97 419 485; do
  # 각 케이스의 마지막 started 이후 에러 찾기
  err=\$(awk -v cc=\"case \$c\" '\$0 ~ (\"started PEAK \" cc \" \") {ln=NR; buf=\"\"} {a[NR]=\$0} END{for(i=ln;i<=NR;i++){if(a[i]~/negative Jacobian/){print \"NEGJAC\";exit} if(a[i]~/cannot reshape|not enough values/){print \"RESHAPE\";exit} if(a[i]~/failed to start|Error in instance GRPC/){print \"gRPC\";exit}}}' PEAK_batch.log);
  echo \"case \$c: \${err:-?}\";
done"

ssh ws2 "cd /home/jeff/project/54_analysis;
echo '=== neg-Jac 케이스들이 low는 성공했나? (같은 LAP_mesh 사용) ===';
for c in 120 147 15 163 37 43 93 96 97 419 485; do
  low=\$(ls ansys_LAP_0728/case_\$c/FC_case_\${c}_low.vtk 2>/dev/null && echo Y || echo N);
  mesh=\$([ -f LAP_mesh/solid_LAP_\$c.msh ]&&echo Y||echo N);
  printf 'case %s: low.vtk=%s mesh=%s\n' \$c \"\$(ls ansys_LAP_0728/case_\$c/FC_case_\${c}_low.vtk 2>/dev/null|wc -l)\" \$mesh;
done;
echo '=== 참고: 원래 reference peak.vtu(403개)는 어떤 메쉬로 만들었나? solid_data type2 존재? ===';
for c in 120 147 15; do
  echo \"case \$c: type2mesh=\$([ -f solid_data/case_\$c/total_solid_type2.msh ]&&echo Y||echo N) refpeak(old)=\$(ls solid_data/case_\$c/ansys_results_type1_expB_new/FC_case_\${c}_peak.vtu 2>/dev/null|wc -l)\";
done"

ssh ws2 "cd /home/jeff/project/54_analysis;
echo '=== 전체 로그에서 negative Jacobian 뜬 distinct 케이스 ===';
negjac=\$(awk '/\[pool\] started PEAK case/{c=\$5} /negative Jacobian/{print c}' PEAK_batch.log|sort -un);
echo \"\$negjac\"|tr '\n' ' '; echo;
echo -n 'neg-Jac 개수: '; echo \"\$negjac\"|grep -c .;
echo -n '그중 0-499: '; echo \"\$negjac\"|awk '\$1<500'|grep -c .;
echo -n '그중 500-999: '; echo \"\$negjac\"|awk '\$1>=500'|grep -c .;
echo '=== reshape(손상) distinct ===';
awk '/\[pool\] started PEAK case/{c=\$5} /cannot reshape|not enough values/{print c}' PEAK_batch.log|sort -un|tr '\n' ' '; echo;
echo '=== 현재 실행중 + 남은 failcases 중 아직 에러유형 미확인 것 (진짜 gRPC 후보) ===';
